if it is wrong it is wrong to the SOUTH, by up to about a lot depth. Facade bearing 0, due north onto Lake, INFERRED FROM THE 25 FT STRIP RATHER THAN FROM ANY STATEMENT about which way the church faced: a strip 25 ft deep measured north-south puts the 40 ft dimension east-west and the long elevation parallel to Lake Street. The slough that lay in front of the church at this corner, which the congregation crossed on planks and benches in the spring, is not modelled. REFUSED 2026-08-27 (T-0196), IN WRITING AND WITH THE NUMBERS THAT REFUSED IT. This record carries the same fault the three Lake Street placements reconciled beside it carried: the cross-street coordinate was taken off a MODERN kerb line read from OpenStreetMap rather than off this project's committed Lake Street centreline, and measured against the committed line this footprint's north wall stands 1.90 m OUT PAST the blk_lake_lasalle frontage line, in the platted roadway. tools/generate_frontage_works.py's march refuses two steps of Lake Street's plank sidewalk for it — 88.6 to 99.0 m along that face — and names this building in the refusal. THE REPAIR WAS MEASURED AND REFUSED FOR A FORTNIGHT, AND THE NUMBER IS WHY: the same derivation the other three take translates this footprint 3.395 m along the face's inward normal, and physicians_office stood 3.15 m behind it on the same lot — blk_lake_lasalle lot 6, which also carries recon_1835_south_a3_043 and recon_1835_south_d6_012. Moved 0.2 m the two were inside the 3.0 m the separation gate requires; moved 3.2 m they physically OVERLAPPED. There was no translation along this normal that both cleared the walk and left the pair standing apart, so WHAT WAS BEING ASKED WAS A RULE AND NOT A METRE: physicians_office is a product of the inferred-household programme, carrying reconstruction.status \"inferred_household\" and standing 8.90 m back from the frontage line on the lot a documented church would come onto, and whether a documented building displaces an inferred household unit decides what this town's evidence layers owe each other. That went to the owner as T-0251 with all three options measured.\n\nTHE OWNER RULED ON 2026-09-21 AND THE RULE IS GENERAL: where an ATTESTED placement and an INFERRED placement collide on one lot, the attested one stands and the inferred one moves or is withdrawn. \"A building the sources put on a street is the kind of thing this project exists to hold; a unit the reconstruction placed is a best guess, and a best guess that displaces a document has the method backwards.\" He refused the third option in terms — narrowing the two footprints to make 3.395 m and 3.15 m fit would leave two buildings sized to each other rather than to their evidence — and left what happens to the office to the run, re-seating before withdrawal. RECONCILED HERE ON THAT RULING, 2026-09-26, BY THIS RECORD'S OWN METHOD RUN AGAINST THIS PROJECT'S OWN LINE: the footprint is translated 3.395 m along the face's inward normal — dE -0.028 m, dN -3.395 m in local ENU, so UTM E 447625.34 N 4637263.61 becomes E 447625.312 N 4637260.215 — which leaves its north wall 1.50 m back from the committed frontage line, the same margin tools/generate_block_infill.py gives every reconstructed unit on this face and the same one old_bank_building, dole_warehouse_south and st_marys_church took under T-0196. NOTHING ALONG THE STREET MOVED: the along-face position, the block, the corner and the side are untouched, and so is the confidence grade — re-deriving a coordinate from better geometry is not new evidence, and every uncertainty stated above still stands at its stated size, including the one-directional lot-depth error toward the south. WHAT MOVED INSTEAD WAS physicians_office, which vacated the ground and was RE-SEATED rather than withdrawn: it keeps its Lake Street frontage band, its face and this same lot 6, 12.99 m west along the face and forward onto the street line, which is its own C1 clause's answer. Its card carries the rule and the numbers that displaced it. Measured after both moves, the nearest committed footprint to this one is physicians_office at 3.101 m, clear of the 3.0 m the separation gate requires, the next is recon_1835_south_d6_012 at 7.78 m, and no committed footprint in the town overlaps this one by a square centimetre. THE SEPARATION GATE WAS NOT WEAKENED AND NEITHER FOOTPRINT WAS NARROWED. The two steps of Lake Street's plank walk this record refused — 88.6 to 99.0 m along blk_lake_lasalle's north face — are laid by tools/generate_frontage_works.py's own march now that the wall is off the roadway; nothing in that generator was relaxed to lay them.",
